  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Сетевой проигрыватель Cambridge Audio CXN100 — Network music streamer with ESS ES9028Q2M DAC, Gen 4 StreamMagic platform, wired and wireless connectivity, and balanced/unbalanced analogue outputs. Характеристики ниже — только с страницы/листа производителя.</p>\n<ul><li>DAC: ESS ES9028Q2M</li><li>Analogue outputs: Balanced XLR and unbalanced RCA</li><li>USB drive, Bluetooth 5.1, S/PDIF coaxial, TOSLINK optical; USB Type </li><li>Maximum local/USB resolution: PCM 32-bit/768 kHz; DSD512</li><li>Frequency response: 20 Hz–20 kHz ±0.1 dB</li></ul>\n<h2>Характеристики производителя</h2>\n<p><strong>DAC</strong>: ESS ES9028Q2M · <strong>Analogue outputs</strong>: Balanced XLR and unbalanced RCA · <strong>Digital inputs</strong>: USB drive, Bluetooth 5.1, S/PDIF coaxial, TOSLINK optical; USB Type B audio input · <strong>Maximum local/USB resolution</strong>: PCM 32-bit/768 kHz; DSD512 · <strong>Frequency response</strong>: 20 Hz–20 kHz ±0.1 dB · <strong>Signal-to-noise ratio</strong>: >120 dBr (ref 1 W).</p>\n<p>Supports AirPlay 2, Chromecast built-in, Spotify Connect, TIDAL, Qobuz, Deezer, Roon Ready, Bluetooth 5.1, Internet Radio and MQA.</p>",
  "shortHtml": "",
  "descriptionText": "Сетевой проигрыватель Cambridge Audio CXN100 — Network music streamer with ESS ES9028Q2M DAC, Gen 4 StreamMagic platform, wired and wireless connectivity, and balanced/unbalanced analogue outputs. Характеристики ниже — только с страницы/листа производителя.\n\n DAC: ESS ES9028Q2M\n Analogue outputs: Balanced XLR and unbalanced RCA\n USB drive, Bluetooth 5.1, S/PDIF coaxial, TOSLINK optical; USB Type\n Maximum local/USB resolution: PCM 32-bit/768 kHz; DSD512\n Frequency response: 20 Hz–20 kHz ±0.1 dB\n\n Характеристики производителя\n\n DAC : ESS ES9028Q2M · Analogue outputs : Balanced XLR and unbalanced RCA · Digital inputs : USB drive, Bluetooth 5.1, S/PDIF coaxial, TOSLINK optical; USB Type B audio input · Maximum local/USB resolution : PCM 32-bit/768 kHz; DSD512 · Frequency response : 20 Hz–20 kHz ±0.1 dB · Signal-to-noise ratio : >120 dBr (ref 1 W).\n\n Supports AirPlay 2, Chromecast built-in, Spotify Connect, TIDAL, Qobuz, Deezer, Roon Ready, Bluetooth 5.1, Internet Radio and MQA.",
